    "version": "0.1.0",
    "name": "Approval Gate",
    "description": "Human approval request over HTTP. POSTs an approval job to base_url/jobs (an externally visible write) and polls every 30 seconds for up to 900 seconds until it completes. rejected and expired are listed as failure statuses. Whether a failed poll stops dependent nodes is unverified, so the effect service must confirm the approval itself, by reading the job's status_url and checking for status completed, before acting. Credentials arrive only through the headers input. This graph references no secrets.",
